iv class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(27年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"96.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,12.8 9.1,30.7 14.2,35.2 19.3,30.7 24.5,32.9 29.6,31.0 34.7,34.1 39.8,28.6 44.9,17.9 50.0,20.8 55.1,20.0 60.3,27.0 65.4,33.0 70.5,37.2 75.6,36.8 80.7,23.4 85.8,50.9 91.0,55.8 96.1,58.0 101.2,59.2 106.3,63.4 111.4,64.8 116.5,69.6 121.6,74.9 126.8,67.9 131.9,65.4 137.0,54.8 142.1,61.0 147.2,65.0 152.3,70.2 157.4,67.8 162.6,63.3 167.7,69.7 172.8,67.0 177.9,68.3 183.0,71.7 188.1,69.4 193.2,81.1 198.4,76.6 203.5,67.1 208.6,58.9 213.7,58.3 218.8,62.1 223.9,54.1 229.0,52.2 234.2,43.7 239.3,67.2 244.4,63.9 249.5,65.5 254.6,68.6 259.7,71.3 264.9,76.2 270.0,76.6 275.1,81.7 280.2,86.6 285.3,88.9 290.4,96.3 295.5,89.6 300.7,95.7 305.8,97.2 310.9,88.8 316.0,91.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 24.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 290.4 108.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"91.4\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"86.5\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\